Error [jet.SwitchConditionMismatch]: `#Off(.Deep)` is not a switch attribute.
  --> tests/ui/switch_condition_mismatch.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     #Off(.Deep) print("never")
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `#Off` takes `.Release` and `#On` takes `.Deep`: each build condition belongs to one marker.
 Fix: Write `#On(.Deep)`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0397
